# proofs/TicketLock.syntax: the allowlist of Lean syntax node kinds proofs/check.sh accepts in TicketLock.lean
# (rule "syntax"; checker/Syntax.lean lists the kinds of a file by parsing it, without elaborating it). These
# are the kinds TicketLock.lean used on 2026-11-18: declarations (def, theorem, structure, inductive with
# deriving), terms, and the tactics of its proofs. Nothing here runs code at elaboration time: no #eval,
# run_cmd, elab, macro, syntax, notation, initialize, set_option, attribute, import, open, or run_tac. A new
# kind is added only by a reviewed change, after checking what it can do.
